    "describe_eh": "The billiards movement looks at and makes mathematics and physics concept up, require personal stability and ability to resist person who press, train group consciousness help each other cooperation die the spirit that struggles.\r\n Set up good sport sports idea, raise student noble quality and is it is it teach on happy to reside to reach.\r\n",
